    <section class="section faq-section" id="faq-preview" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <!-- Section Introduction -->
        <div class="faq-editorial-header reveal-on-scroll">
          <div class="faq-eyebrow-wrap">
            <span class="faq-eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="faq-eyebrow-text">FREQUENT QUESTIONS</span>
            <span class="faq-eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <h2 id="faq-heading" class="faq-editorial-title">
            Common Questions About<br />
            <span class="gold-text">Trademarks.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="faq-editorial-desc">
            Clear, practical answers to essential questions founders and business owners ask before starting a trademark or registration enquiry.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Numbered Editorial FAQ List -->
        <div class="faq-editorial-list" id="faq-accordion-container">
          <!-- Item 01 -->
          <details class="faq-row-item faq-details">
            <summary class="faq-row-summary faq-summary">
              <div class="faq-row-lead">
                <span class="faq-row-num">01</span>
                <span class="faq-row-vbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="faq-row-question">What is a trademark?</span>
              </div>
              <span class="faq-row-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="faq-toggle-svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <line class="line-h" x1="2" y1="7" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>A trademark protects your distinctive brand name, logo, slogan, or commercial symbol used in connection with goods or services. Registration under the Trade Marks Act grants statutory nationwide exclusive rights, deters deceptive imitation, and secures brand equity as your business grows.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 02 -->
          <details class="faq-row-item faq-details">
            <summary class="faq-row-summary faq-summary">
              <div class="faq-row-lead">
                <span class="faq-row-num">02</span>
                <span class="faq-row-vbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="faq-row-question">How do I begin a trademark registration enquiry?</span>
              </div>
              <span class="faq-row-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="faq-toggle-svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <line class="line-h" x1="2" y1="7" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>You can begin by sharing your proposed brand name, logo concept, and a brief description of your products or services via WhatsApp or our enquiry channels. We conduct a preliminary discussion to assess relevant classes and identify potentially conflicting marks before filing.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 03 -->
          <details class="faq-row-item faq-details">
            <summary class="faq-row-summary faq-summary">
              <div class="faq-row-lead">
                <span class="faq-row-num">03</span>
                <span class="faq-row-vbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="faq-row-question">How do trademark classes work?</span>
              </div>
              <span class="faq-row-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="faq-toggle-svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <line class="line-h" x1="2" y1="7" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>India follows the international Nice Classification system of 45 classes: Classes 1 to 34 cover physical goods (e.g. food, clothing, cosmetics), while Classes 35 to 45 cover services (e.g. retail, consulting, software). Applications must specify the exact classes that correspond to your commercial activities.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 04 -->
          <details class="faq-row-item faq-details">
            <summary class="faq-row-summary faq-summary">
              <div class="faq-row-lead">
                <span class="faq-row-num">04</span>
                <span class="faq-row-vbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="faq-row-question">What is the difference between a wordmark and a logo trademark?</span>
              </div>
              <span class="faq-row-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="faq-toggle-svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <line class="line-h" x1="2" y1="7" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>A wordmark protects the brand name itself in standard text, offering broad protection regardless of typography or styling. A logo (device mark) protects the distinctive visual symbol, stylized lettering, or emblem. Many businesses file both to secure comprehensive coverage.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 05 -->
          <details class="faq-row-item faq-details">
            <summary class="faq-row-summary faq-summary">
              <div class="faq-row-lead">
                <span class="faq-row-num">05</span>
                <span class="faq-row-vbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="faq-row-question">What information should I prepare?</span>
              </div>
              <span class="faq-row-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="faq-toggle-svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <line class="line-h" x1="2" y1="7" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>Having your proposed brand name, logo file (if available), a brief description of products or services, applicant details (individual, proprietorship, LLP, or company), and commercial usage status helps ensure an efficient initial assessment.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 06 -->
          <details class="faq-row-item faq-details">
            <summary class="faq-row-summary faq-summary">
              <div class="faq-row-lead">
                <span class="faq-row-num">06</span>
                <span class="faq-row-vbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="faq-row-question">Is trademark registration the same as company registration?</span>
              </div>
              <span class="faq-row-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="faq-toggle-svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <line class="line-h" x1="2" y1="7" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>No. Registering a company, LLP, or GST establishes your legal commercial entity and tax compliance, but does not grant proprietary trademark protection over your brand name. Trademark registration is a separate statutory intellectual property procedure.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 07 -->
          <details class="faq-row-item faq-details">
            <summary class="faq-row-summary faq-summary">
              <div class="faq-row-lead">
                <span class="faq-row-num">07</span>
                <span class="faq-row-vbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="faq-row-question">What can affect the time required for an application?</span>
              </div>
              <span class="faq-row-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="faq-toggle-svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <line class="line-h" x1="2" y1="7" x2="12" y2="7"></line>
                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>Trademark timelines depend on Trade Marks Registry examination workloads, whether the examiner issues examination report objections, whether third parties file oppositions during publication, and the promptness of responses to official queries. We monitor every stage to avoid avoidable administrative delays.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Item 08 -->
          <details class="faq-row-item faq-details">
            <summary class="faq-row-summary faq-summary">
              <div class="faq-row-lead">
                <span class="faq-row-num">08</span>
                <span class="faq-row-vbar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
