                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>Statutory official government fees are prescribed by the Trade Marks Registry (with a 50% concession for individuals, startups, and MSMEs). BRNDNUR provides a transparent, itemised breakdown of official fees and our professional advisory charges before any work begins, so you know the full scope upfront.</p>
